            <http://data.sparna.fr/ontologies/sparnatural-config-core#sparqlString> ""@fr ;
            rdfs:label "est de type"@fr .


###  https://sipaof.fr/expertes#test
:test rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
      rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://data.sparna.fr/ontologies/sparnatural-config-core#ListProperty> ;
